graph TD
    A[Start: Run Code] --> B{Syntax<br/>Check}
    B -- Fail --> C[<b>Syntax Error</b>
Code never runs]
    B -- Pass --> E
    E{Runtime<br/>Operation}
    E -- Illegal Op
e.g. Div by 0 --> F[<b>Runtime Error</b>
Crash!]
    E -- Valid Op --> G{Check<br/>Result}
    G -- Wrong Outcome --> H[<b>Logical Error</b>
Silent Failure]
    G -- Correct Outcome --> I[<b>Success</b>]
    
    style C fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style F fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style H fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style I fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px